32.7,1976,70,109,15],[31384,32.4,2000,70,104,18]],"links":[["Mackinac County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/michigan/mackinac-county"],["ARC or PLC in Mackinac County","/arc-plc/michigan/mackinac-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Mackinac County record runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 15 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 32 of those years, and in 2025 it came in at 66%. Grid 31084 had its driest year in 2000, at 70% of normal.</p>"}
